    LLM: 'Three players, seven cards each. Trump turned (acorns cannot be trumps). Four tricks needed to win Spiel. Players may bet on Gleich, Hanger or Spiel; opponents concede, hold or raise. Winner of Spiel begins the show to resolve Gleich and Hanger. Unbet figures scored in order: Spiel, Gleich, Hanger.',
    Player: 'Three players, seven cards each. Trump turned (acorns cannot be trumps). Four tricks needed to win Spiel. Players may bet on Gleich, Hanger or Spiel; opponents concede, hold or raise. Winner of Spiel begins the show to resolve Gleich and Hanger. Unbet figures scored in order: Spiel, Gleich, Hanger.',
